      "repair_reason": "- [P2] A browser owner must decide whether the intentional stale-target recovery contract is acceptable before this otherwise reviewable PR can merge.; Cleared: The diff changes browser target-selection semantics and adds a local proof harness, but it adds no dependency, credential, permission, workflow, or supply-chain execution surface. (sha=aa12f71913534a7761b8f0ea7ba5c9ca5722293b)",
